WEBVTT

00:03:25.642 --> 00:03:30.560
xohish-istaklar olovini so'ndirish 
uchun dasturi amal topdi.

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:34.199
Yozuvchi Tsao Syuetsin Xitoyning 
eng mashhur klassik romanlaridan biri

00:03:34.199 --> 00:03:39.182
"Qizil ko'shkdagi tush" asarida 
buddistlarning romantik

00:03:39.182 --> 00:03:41.900
sevgi – bema'nilikdir, degan
qarashini ochib beradi.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:45.370
Sujet voqealaridan birida Tzya Rui 
uni aldab,

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:47.680
xo'rlab ketuvchi Sifengga oshiq bo'ladi.

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:51.293
Muhabbat va nafratga to'la qarama-qarshi 
hislar uning qalbini parchalaydi,

00:03:51.293 --> 00:03:55.159
shu bois daos unga sehrli ko'zgu beradi.
Agar Tzya Rui

00:03:55.159 --> 00:03:57.765
unga qaramasa, dardiga davo 
topishini aytadi.

00:03:57.765 --> 00:04:00.370
Ammo u, o'z-o'zidan ravshanki, 
ko'zguga boqadi.